  m_text: '<b>Ahoy there, Chef Stumpy!</b>


    So ye''ve lost yer sword arm to
    a kraken, eh? No worries - Cap''n says ye still cook better with one arm than
    Cookie did with two! The crew''s bellies are rumblin'' louder than cannon fire,
    and we''ve got enemies on the horizon.


    <b>Now get cookin'', ye scurvy dog!
    The fate of the ship depends on yer stew!</b>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
